%%% note
Vectors コネクタ (mule4-vectors-connector 1.0.0): 埋め込み (偽の Ollama)、分割、文書の読み取り、ephemeral-file の保存先への追加・検索・一覧・削除。
%%% jvm -Dvectors.dir=/tmp/mulay-vectors-ops
%%% port 18460
%%% mask
([0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12})
ingestion_timestamp": ?(\d+)
ingestion_datetime": ?"([^"]+)"
%%% request GET /reset
%%% response 200

ok
%%% request POST /embed
content-type: application/json

{"texts":["where is my order?","the weather is nice"]}
